{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01578","headline":"琴曲歌辞 胡笳十八拍 第十二拍 · 刘商","name":"琴曲歌辞 胡笳十八拍 第十二拍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"破瓶落井空永沈，故乡望断无归心。\n宁知远使问姓名，汉语泠泠传好音。\n梦魂几度到乡国，觉後翻成哀怨深。\n如今果是梦中事，喜过悲来情不任。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01578.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01578","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}